            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8' underline='true'>Definition:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>MAU with sufficient points: </run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>Of all the live scratch cards, sufficient points is defined as the </run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' underline='true'>minimum number of points to redeem a scratch card in that month and country.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>Redeemers: </run>
